# What does NOT go into the .vsix.
#
# Inverted from .gitignore's logic: everything is included unless listed, so
# this file is the one place a stray artifact gets caught. The two rules
# that matter are the last ones — a nested node_modules under the linked
# `hoverlab` dependency, and any editor state that happened to be in the
# folder.

.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
**/.eslintrc.json
**/*.map
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# The one runtime dependency IS shipped — the extension does nothing without
# it — but its own development files are not.
node_modules/hoverlab/node_modules/**
node_modules/hoverlab/**/*.test.mjs
node_modules/hoverlab/test/**
node_modules/.package-lock.json
